            <div xml:id="d771">

                <pb facs="0905" n="787" sameAs="frus:frus1928v02/pg787"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">884.6461 Tsana Dam/48a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Southard</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-10-01T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 1,
                                1928—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>13. It is requested by the J. G. White Engineering Corporation that you be
                    informed as follows:</p>
                <p>Release of information given under authorization of Ras Tafari in your letter to
                    them of 26th April has been awaited by the corporation <pb facs="0906" n="788"
                        xml:id="pg788"/> with strictest confidence. They are also waiting for an
                    invitation from Ras Tafari to send representative to London to cooperate in
                    working out agreement with British and Sudan Governments in accordance with
                    program discussed with Martin. They ask that you submit an inquiry to Ras Taf
                    ari in their behalf as to whether matters have progressed sufficiently to
                    justify discussion in London by all interested parties. The present time is
                    considered especially opportune by them for the initiation of such discussions
                    in London.</p>
                <p>It is understood by the White Corporation that Martin is now in England for his
                    health. Regarding the purpose of his visit there, they would be glad to receive
                    latest information.</p>
                <p>Of course, you will telegraph through the Department your reply to the
                    foregoing.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
